    .. code:: python

        U, S, Vh = torch.linalg.svd(A, full_matrices=not some)
        V = Vh.mH

    ``_, S, _ = torch.svd(A, some=some, compute_uv=False)`` should be replaced with

    .. code:: python

        S = torch.linalg.svdvals(A)

